  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": [
    "Show how far the player is from the goal: the distance driven in a race, the progress in a level, the steps of a quest...",
    "",
    "Change its value with the action \"Value\" (from 0 to the maximum value): the bar fills, the marker slides to the progress and the checkpoints passed change. The bar is cut in sections (the \"Number of sections\" property), and its start and goal labels are properties.",
    "",
    "Ready-to-use goal progress bars are in the asset store [goal progress bars pack](https://editor.gdevelop.io/?initial-dialog=asset-store&asset-pack=goal-progress-bars-goal-progress-bars)."
